WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.530
- But last year you got married, right?

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:02.363
- Yes.
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:00:02.363 --> 00:00:04.500
Did everything go as
planned, or was anything-

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.030
- Yeah, I mean, most
of it went as planned.

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.190
I tried to, I, you know,
we did the best we could.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.665
We had a wedding planner,
but you know, like life-

00:00:10.665 --> 00:00:11.498
- [Kelly] Yep.

00:00:11.498 --> 00:00:15.060
- Things happen and you have
to sort of go with the flow.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:15.893
- Yeah.
- I mean,

00:00:15.893 --> 00:00:17.730
there was an issue with
the bus that was supposed

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.190
to take everyone from
the hotel to the venue,

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.960
which was less than a mile by the way,

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:22.830
so they could have walked,

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.240
and it would've been less problematic,

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:28.004
but it hit a curb, then hit another curb.

00:00:28.004 --> 00:00:28.950
- [Kelly] What?

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:30.360
- Got lost.
- Is everyone okay?

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.650
Got lost, and it was a mile away.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.291
- And then tried to drop everyone off

00:00:33.291 --> 00:00:35.130
in the middle of nowhere.

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.081
- Was the driver inebriated?

00:00:37.081 --> 00:00:37.914
(laughing) like.
- No.

00:00:37.914 --> 00:00:39.480
- I was like, "Wait."

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.313
- No.

00:00:40.313 --> 00:00:41.880
I think maybe there was a wrong-

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:42.810
- Miscommunication.

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:43.643
- Yes.

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:46.620
I don't wanna throw anyone
under the bus, so to speak.

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:47.453
- Yeah.

00:00:47.453 --> 00:00:48.570
- But it was-
- On TV. (laughing)

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:49.403
- That's right.

00:00:49.403 --> 00:00:53.010
But it was, it ended up
being fine, but there...

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:55.110
And no one really wanted
to bring it up to me,

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.210
but then of course, my best
friend was like, "Oh my God,

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:58.290
it was a disaster."

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.123
- [Kelly] Yeah. (laughing)

00:00:59.123 --> 00:01:00.195
- We were all on the side of the road,

00:01:00.195 --> 00:01:02.670
and we were like, "We don't
think this is it, and..."

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:04.740
But then you just sort
of go with the flow,

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:07.410
and not take it too seriously.

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.760
- [Kelly] I saw the pictures.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:09.810
It looked magical.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.640
That flower thing behind you.

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:12.840
The wall of beauty.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:13.673
- [Guest] Beautiful.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:14.700
- [Kelly] Yeah, and that's so cute.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.773
You're such a handsome couple, anyway.

